{"page":543,"verses":[{"verse_key":"58:7","surah":58,"ayah":7,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ تَرَ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَعْلَمُ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ مَا يَكُونُ مِن نَّجْوَىٰ ثَلَـٰثَةٍ إِلَّا هُوَ رَابِعُهُمْ وَلَا خَمْسَةٍ إِلَّا هُوَ سَادِسُهُمْ وَلَآ أَدْنَىٰ مِن ذَٰلِكَ وَلَآ أَكْثَرَ إِلَّا هُوَ مَعَهُمْ أَيْنَ مَا كَانُوا۟ ۖ ثُمَّ يُنَبِّئُهُم بِمَا عَمِلُوا۟ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ بِكُلِّ شَىْءٍ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do you not see [Prophet] that God knows everything in the heavens and earth? There is no secret conversation between three people where He is not the fourth, nor between five where He is not the sixth, nor between less or more than that without Him being with them, wherever they may be. On the Day of Resurrection, He will show them what they have done: God truly has full knowledge of everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرَ","en_gloss":"you see","transliteration":"tara","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"whatever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَكُونُ","en_gloss":"there is","transliteration":"yakūnu","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":15,"ar":"نَّجْوَىٰ","en_gloss":"secret counsel","transliteration":"najwā","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ثَلَـٰثَةٍ","en_gloss":"(of) three","transliteration":"thalāthatin","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":17,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":18,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He (is)","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":19,"ar":"رَابِعُهُمْ","en_gloss":"(the) fourth of them","transliteration":"rābiʿuhum","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":21,"ar":"خَمْسَةٍ","en_gloss":"five","transliteration":"khamsatin","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":22,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":23,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He (is)","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":24,"ar":"سَادِسُهُمْ","en_gloss":"(the) sixth of them","transliteration":"sādisuhum","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":25,"ar":"وَلَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":26,"ar":"أَدْنَىٰ","en_gloss":"less","transliteration":"adnā","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":27,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"than","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":28,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":29,"ar":"وَلَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":30,"ar":"أَكْثَرَ","en_gloss":"more","transliteration":"akthara","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":31,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":32,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":33,"ar":"مَعَهُمْ","en_gloss":"(is) with them","transliteration":"maʿahum","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":34,"ar":"أَيْنَ","en_gloss":"wherever","transliteration":"ayna","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":35,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"wherever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":36,"ar":"كَانُوا۟ ۖ","en_gloss":"they are","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":37,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":38,"ar":"يُنَبِّئُهُم","en_gloss":"He will inform them","transliteration":"yunabbi-uhum","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":39,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":40,"ar":"عَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"they did","transliteration":"ʿamilū","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":41,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":42,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":43,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":44,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":45,"ar":"بِكُلِّ","en_gloss":"of every","transliteration":"bikulli","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":46,"ar":"شَىْءٍ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":47,"ar":"عَلِيمٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"58:7"},{"pos":48,"ar":"٧","en_gloss":"(7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"58:7"}]},{"verse_key":"58:8","surah":58,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ تَرَ إِلَى ٱلَّذِينَ نُهُوا۟ عَنِ ٱلنَّجْوَىٰ ثُمَّ يَعُودُونَ لِمَا نُهُوا۟ عَنْهُ وَيَتَنَـٰجَوْنَ بِٱلْإِثْمِ وَٱلْعُدْوَٰنِ وَمَعْصِيَتِ ٱلرَّسُولِ وَإِذَا جَآءُوكَ حَيَّوْكَ بِمَا لَمْ يُحَيِّكَ بِهِ ٱللَّهُ وَيَقُولُونَ فِىٓ أَنفُسِهِمْ لَوْلَا يُعَذِّبُنَا ٱللَّهُ بِمَا نَقُولُ ۚ حَسْبُهُمْ جَهَنَّمُ يَصْلَوْنَهَا ۖ فَبِئْسَ ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Have you not seen how those who have been forbidden to hold secret conversations go back afterwards and hold them, and conspire with one another in what is sinful, hostile, and disobedient to the Messenger? When they come to you they greet you with words God has never used to greet you, and say inwardly, ‘Why does God not punish us for what we say?’ Hell will be punishment enough for them: they will burn there- an evil destination.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرَ","en_gloss":"you see","transliteration":"tara","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"[to]","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نُهُوا۟","en_gloss":"were forbidden","transliteration":"nuhū","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلنَّجْوَىٰ","en_gloss":"secret counsels","transliteration":"l-najwā","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَعُودُونَ","en_gloss":"they return","transliteration":"yaʿūdūna","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِمَا","en_gloss":"to what","transliteration":"limā","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":11,"ar":"نُهُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were forbidden","transliteration":"nuhū","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَنْهُ","en_gloss":"from [it]","transliteration":"ʿanhu","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَيَتَنَـٰجَوْنَ","en_gloss":"and they hold secret counsels","transliteration":"wayatanājawna","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِٱلْإِثْمِ","en_gloss":"for sin","transliteration":"bil-ith'mi","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَٱلْعُدْوَٰنِ","en_gloss":"and aggression","transliteration":"wal-ʿud'wāni","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَمَعْصِيَتِ","en_gloss":"and disobedience","transliteration":"wamaʿṣiyati","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولِ","en_gloss":"(to) the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūli","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":19,"ar":"جَآءُوكَ","en_gloss":"they come to you","transliteration":"jāūka","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":20,"ar":"حَيَّوْكَ","en_gloss":"they greet you","transliteration":"ḥayyawka","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":21,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"with what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":22,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":23,"ar":"يُحَيِّكَ","en_gloss":"greets you","transliteration":"yuḥayyika","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":24,"ar":"بِهِ","en_gloss":"therewith","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":26,"ar":"وَيَقُولُونَ","en_gloss":"and they say","transliteration":"wayaqūlūna","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":27,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":28,"ar":"أَنفُسِهِمْ","en_gloss":"themselves","transliteration":"anfusihim","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":29,"ar":"لَوْلَا","en_gloss":"Why (does) not","transliteration":"lawlā","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":30,"ar":"يُعَذِّبُنَا","en_gloss":"Allah punish us","transliteration":"yuʿadhibunā","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":31,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah punish us","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":32,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":33,"ar":"نَقُولُ ۚ","en_gloss":"we say","transliteration":"naqūlu","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":34,"ar":"حَسْبُهُمْ","en_gloss":"Sufficient (for) them","transliteration":"ḥasbuhum","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":35,"ar":"جَهَنَّمُ","en_gloss":"(is) Hell","transliteration":"jahannamu","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":36,"ar":"يَصْلَوْنَهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"they will burn in it","transliteration":"yaṣlawnahā","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":37,"ar":"فَبِئْسَ","en_gloss":"and worst is","transliteration":"fabi'sa","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":38,"ar":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_gloss":"the destination","transliteration":"l-maṣīru","verse_key":"58:8"},{"pos":39,"ar":"٨","en_gloss":"(8)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"58:8"}]},{"verse_key":"58:9","surah":58,"ayah":9,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ إِذَا تَنَـٰجَيْتُمْ فَلَا تَتَنَـٰجَوْا۟ بِٱلْإِثْمِ وَٱلْعُدْوَٰنِ وَمَعْصِيَتِ ٱلرَّسُولِ وَتَنَـٰجَوْا۟ بِٱلْبِرِّ وَٱلتَّقْوَىٰ ۖ وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ ٱلَّذِىٓ إِلَيْهِ تُحْشَرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, when you converse in secret, do not do so in a way that is sinful, hostile, and disobedient to the Messenger, but in a way that is good and mindful [of God]. Be mindful of God, to whom you will all be gathered.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"58:9"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"58:9"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"58:9"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"When","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"58:9"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَنَـٰجَيْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you hold secret counsel","transliteration":"tanājaytum","verse_key":"58:9"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"then (do) not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"58:9"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَتَنَـٰجَوْا۟","en_gloss":"hold secret counsel","transliteration":"tatanājaw","verse_key":"58:9"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱلْإِثْمِ","en_gloss":"for sin","transliteration":"bil-ith'mi","verse_key":"58:9"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱلْعُدْوَٰنِ","en_gloss":"and aggression","transliteration":"wal-ʿud'wāni","verse_key":"58:9"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَعْصِيَتِ","en_gloss":"and disobedience","transliteration":"wamaʿṣiyati","verse_key":"58:9"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولِ","en_gloss":"(to) the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūli","verse_key":"58:9"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَتَنَـٰجَوْا۟","en_gloss":"but hold secret counsel","transliteration":"watanājaw","verse_key":"58:9"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِٱلْبِرِّ","en_gloss":"for righteousness","transliteration":"bil-biri","verse_key":"58:9"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَ